WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:14,180
Yundong

2
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:16,630
When you get to the army, take care of yourself and work hard.

3
00:00:16,830 --> 00:00:18,030
Give our family a voice

4
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:19,830
Mom and Dad, don’t worry

5
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:23,030
Listen, be obedient and wait for my brother to come back ten years ago

6
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:24,630
My family can’t afford for me to continue studying.

7
00:00:24,630 --> 00:00:26,630
I chose to join the army and this is my journey

8
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:28,030
Just ten years

9
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:42,540
these ten years

10
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:43,740
I joined the special forces

11
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,740
Has been performing tasks on the battlefield

12
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:49,260
Because of confidentiality requirements

13
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:56,910
I stopped talking to my parents at home.

14
00:00:57,310 --> 00:00:59,580
It's because I came back ten years late

15
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:01,180
I couldn't enter the school beside you

16
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:04,500
After letting Tingting suffer too much alone,

17
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:06,500
I won't leave her brother behind again

18
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:08,700
You must avenge dad and mom

19
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:10,700
They suffer from being bullied

20
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:12,840
They are too bitter

21
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:17,340
These things are not your concern

22
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:18,740
Your most important task now

23
00:01:18,740 --> 00:01:21,140
Just go back to school to prepare for the college entrance examination

24
00:01:22,430 --> 00:01:23,830
I also want to go to school

25
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:25,660
But how can we have money?

26
00:01:25,860 --> 00:01:27,460
The three hundred thousand you got back from the army

27
00:01:27,460 --> 00:01:33,350
I bought them all. This is my business. Let you go to school and live a good life.

28
00:01:33,350 --> 00:01:34,850
It's my responsibility your responsibility

29
00:01:34,850 --> 00:01:36,050
Just go to school well

30
00:01:36,450 --> 00:01:37,450
Get into a good university

31
00:01:43,990 --> 00:01:45,990
Take a taxi first and buy some food on the way.

32
00:01:46,190 --> 00:01:50,900
You can buy whatever you want to eat. I'll go out and wait until I get back to do the math. Where are you going?

33
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:59,140
You won't leave me alone again? Don't worry, I won't leave again.

34
00:01:59,900 --> 00:02:00,900
before you get married and start a family

35
00:02:00,900 --> 00:02:05,100
Brother will never leave you alone again. You go back first. I have something to deal with. Once I’m done, I’ll go back.
